cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'If you wish to cite the "r-project-template" repository use:'
type: software
license: BSD 3-Clause
title: r-project-template
version: 0.3.0
abstract: >-
  A template for R projects that is not an R package, exploring recent
  tools from the R ecosystem: box for modular code organization instead
  of package namespaces, rv for dependency management, air for
  formatting, jarl for linting, and quartify for generating Quarto
  documentation. Includes a justfile, testthat testing, pre-commit
  hooks, GitHub Actions CI, and automated semantic releases.
